{"seq":2,"slug":"vertical-saas-and-moats","title":"垂直 SaaS 与护城河侵蚀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/vertical-saas-and-moats","wordCount":2241,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"垂直-saas-与护城河侵蚀\">垂直 SaaS 与护城河侵蚀</h1><p>2026 年的垂直 SaaS（vertical SaaS，针对单一行业打造的软件，如法律、保险理赔、诊所管理）正处在一个奇怪的双重叙事里：一边，市场规模约 1640 亿美元、CAGR 约 11.5%，增速是横向 SaaS 的两三倍（<a href=\"https://www.saasmag.com/vertical-saas-outperforming-horizontal-2026/\">SaaS Mag</a>）；另一边，「AI 正在吃掉企业软件」的判词此起彼伏，许多过去被当作护城河的东西——专有 UI、学习成本、数据解析层——正被大模型快速抹平。这篇文档要拆清楚：在「平台竞争格局与护城河」的语境下，到底是哪几条护城河被侵蚀了，哪几条反而被加固了，以及底层经济学为什么会这样演化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-护城河的-上移\">核心概念：护城河的「上移」</h2><p>护城河侵蚀的本质，不是垂直 SaaS 整体被淘汰，而是防御价值从「功能层」上移到了「工作流层」。当基础模型（foundation model）能力商品化、推理价格逼近于零时，「我家有这个功能」不再构成壁垒——竞争对手用大模型一周就能复刻。Ardent Venture Partners 把这件事概括成一句话：<a href=\"https://medium.com/@ardent-vc/the-moat-just-moved-areas-of-opportunity-in-ai-native-software-6bf9619552f3\">The moat just moved</a>（护城河搬家了）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[基础模型能力商品化&lt;br/&gt;推理价格逼近于零] --&gt; B[功能层壁垒崩塌&lt;br/&gt;专有UI/快捷键/解析层]&#10;  A --&gt; C[竞品快速复刻功能&lt;br/&gt;复制周期以周计]&#10;  B --&gt; D{价值往哪里转移?}&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[工作流所有权&lt;br/&gt;业务真正运转的地方]&#10;  D --&gt; F[专有运营数据&lt;br/&gt;行业级私有数据]&#10;  D --&gt; G[嵌入式金融与合规&lt;br/&gt;受监管基础设施]&#10;  E --&gt; H[新护城河:&lt;br/&gt;切换成本+多方协作+结果交付]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[基础模型能力商品化&lt;br/&gt;推理价格逼近于零] --&gt; B[功能层壁垒崩塌&lt;br/&gt;专有UI/快捷键/解析层]\n  A --&gt; C[竞品快速复刻功能&lt;br/&gt;复制周期以周计]\n  B --&gt; D{价值往哪里转移?}\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[工作流所有权&lt;br/&gt;业务真正运转的地方]\n  D --&gt; F[专有运营数据&lt;br/&gt;行业级私有数据]\n  D --&gt; G[嵌入式金融与合规&lt;br/&gt;受监管基础设施]\n  E --&gt; H[新护城河:&lt;br/&gt;切换成本+多方协作+结果交付]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 为一个垂直 SaaS 产品的客户感知价值，可以粗略拆成功能价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与工作流/数据/合规价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = V_f + V_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2022—2026 这一轮，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 因模型商品化而趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（人人都能做出同样的功能），于是产品的<strong>可防御价值</strong>几乎全部压在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上。谁的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 高，谁就活；谁过去靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 收租，谁就被侵蚀。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>护城河类型</th>\n<th>2022 年防御力</th>\n<th>2026 年防御力</th>\n<th>被侵蚀 / 被加固</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>专有 UI / 学习成本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>严重侵蚀</td>\n<td>「lock-in」很多只是学到的导航习惯，被 LLM 直接抹平（<a href=\"https://scaled.co.uk/the-vertical-saas-reckoning-which-moats-llms-destroy-and-which-ones-get-stronger/\">Scaled</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能数量 / 套件捆绑</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>严重侵蚀</td>\n<td>自动化打通数据孤岛，捆绑式工作流套件被「蒸发」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据解析 / 结构化层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>侵蚀</td>\n<td>更宽的输入让解析与结构化层商品化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专有运营数据</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>加固</td>\n<td>行业级运营数据可训出横向工具无法复制的预测（<a href=\"https://www.saasmag.com/vertical-saas-outperforming-horizontal-2026/\">SaaS Mag</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作流所有权</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>加固</td>\n<td>真正的防御在「业务实际运转之处」（<a href=\"https://www.vendep.com/post/forget-the-data-moat-the-workflow-is-your-fortress-in-vertical-saas\">Vendep</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入式金融 / 合规</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>加固</td>\n<td>AI 能起草发票却不能结算或放贷，需持牌基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模型商品化-侵蚀的发动机\">模型商品化：侵蚀的发动机</h2><p>护城河侵蚀不是凭空发生的，它的发动机是推理成本的崩塌。把这条曲线看清楚，才能理解为什么「功能护城河」在 2026 年几乎一文不值。</p>\n<p>a16z 称之为 LLMflation（模型通缩）：达到 GPT-4 水平的能力，价格从 2022 年的约 20 美元/百万 token 跌到约 0.40 美元/百万 token（<a href=\"https://a16z.com/llmflation-llm-inference-cost/\">a16z</a>）。Gartner 进一步预测，到 2030 年，在万亿参数模型上做推理的成本将比 2025 年低 90% 以上（<a href=\"https://www.gartner.com/en/newsroom/press-releases/2026-03-25-gartner-predicts-that-by-2030-performing-inference-on-an-llm-with-1-trillion-parameters-will-cost-genai-providers-over-90-percent-less-than-in-2025\">Gartner</a>）。具体到 2026 年的牌价：Claude Sonnet 4.6 约 3 美元/百万输入 token，而 Gemini 3.1 Flash 仅 0.10 美元/百万输入 token、0.40 美元/百万输出 token，被描述为三年内 99.7% 的降价（<a href=\"https://deploybase.ai/articles/cost-per-token-over-time-how-llm-api-pricing-has-dropped\">DeployBase</a>）。DeepSeek 的 90% 砍价更证明：剧烈的低价倾销随时可能再来。</p>\n<p>当智能的边际成本趋近于零，「我家产品里有 AI」就不再是卖点。这就是为什么解析层、分析界面、捆绑套件这三类东西在 2026 年集体失守——它们恰好是最容易被一个便宜模型复刻的部分。</p>\n<p>但这里有一个反直觉的陷阱：<strong>单位经济学改善 ≠ 总账单下降</strong>。当 token 单价下跌的同时消耗量增长得更快，整体推理账单反而上升（<a href=\"https://introl.com/blog/inference-unit-economics-true-cost-per-million-tokens-guide\">Introl</a>）。换言之，靠便宜 token 掩盖架构低效的应用层公司，在 agent 规模化时会发现规模根本跑不起来。这给垂直 SaaS 留了一道缝：谁能把昂贵的「前沿推理」用在刀刃上、把便宜的「商品化 token」用在量上，谁的毛利结构就更健康。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工作流所有权-最硬的那条护城河\">工作流所有权：最硬的那条护城河</h2><p>2026 年最被反复强调的一句话是「忘掉数据护城河——工作流才是你的堡垒」（<a href=\"https://www.vendep.com/post/forget-the-data-moat-the-workflow-is-your-fortress-in-vertical-saas\">Vendep</a>）。这句话需要拆解：数据本身正在从护城河退化为商品（AI 让获取与结构化数据变得廉价），真正不可复制的是「业务在哪里实际运转」——审批链、权限、多方交接、合规留痕。</p>\n<p>会侵蚀你市场地位的竞争者，不是做了更炫功能的人，而是<strong>重建了你客户所依赖的工作流</strong>的人。基础模型公司的标准打法是：先做横向平台，再亲自切入毛利最高的垂直行业。于是创业者真正的问题变成一道时间赛跑：你能否在它们到来之前先把工作流护城河筑起来（<a href=\"https://scaled.co.uk/the-vertical-saas-reckoning-which-moats-llms-destroy-and-which-ones-get-stronger/\">Scaled</a>）。</p>\n<p>把切换成本写成模型会更直观。设客户从你的产品迁走的总成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{switch}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{switch} = C_{data} + C_{retrain} + C_{integration} + C_{compliance}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ian</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>模型商品化把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{retrain}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（学习新 UI 的成本）压到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，但当价值来自多人 + 多 agent 协作、各自有不同权限与合规要求时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{integration}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{compliance}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ian</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反而升高，协作层本身就变成了护城河。垂直 SaaS 的胜负手，正是把防御价值从被抹平的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{retrain}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 转移到这两项上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定价模型的重构-从-席位-到-结果\">定价模型的重构：从「席位」到「结果」</h2><p>护城河上移会直接改写商业模式。当一个人加上一个 AI agent 能干十个人的活，按席位（per-seat）收费就崩了——它默认「价值随人头增长」，而 AI 恰恰是「价值不随人头增长」。Deloitte 与 BetterCloud 都指出：AI agent 作为「用户」会让按席位定价承压，倒逼向用量制（usage-based）与结果制（outcome-based）迁移（<a href=\"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/technology/technology-media-and-telecom-predictions/2026/saas-ai-agents.html\">Deloitte</a>、<a href=\"https://www.bettercloud.com/monitor/saas-industry/\">BetterCloud</a>）。</p>\n<p>结果制定价（按案件、按申报、按解决的工单收费）正在成为垂直行业的自然计价单位。据报道，采用结果制的垂直软件公司，单客户收入能拿到过去席位制的 2—5 倍（<a href=\"https://www.validata.ai/post/from-tools-to-outcomes-why-agentic-ai-is-quietly-replacing-vertical-saas-in-regulated-industries\">Validata</a>）。这批吃下 4500 亿美元以上垂直市场的玩家——Sierra（客服）、Harvey（法律）、Hippocratic AI（医疗）、EvenUp（人身伤害法律）——靠的正是深度集成、领域知识与结果制定价的组合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[传统席位制&lt;br/&gt;价值假设:随人头增长] --&gt; B{AI agent 进入工作流}&#10;  B --&gt; C[一人+一agent 干十人活&lt;br/&gt;人头与价值脱钩]&#10;  C --&gt; D[席位制崩塌]&#10;  D --&gt; E[用量制&lt;br/&gt;按 token/调用计费]&#10;  D --&gt; F[结果制&lt;br/&gt;按案件/申报/解决工单]&#10;  F --&gt; G[单客户收入 2-5x&lt;br/&gt;价值与业务结果挂钩]&#10;  E --&gt; H[混合定价&lt;br/&gt;用量+结果叠加]&#10;  F --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[传统席位制&lt;br/&gt;价值假设:随人头增长] --&gt; B{AI agent 进入工作流}\n  B --&gt; C[一人+一agent 干十人活&lt;br/&gt;人头与价值脱钩]\n  C --&gt; D[席位制崩塌]\n  D --&gt; E[用量制&lt;br/&gt;按 token/调用计费]\n  D --&gt; F[结果制&lt;br/&gt;按案件/申报/解决工单]\n  F --&gt; G[单客户收入 2-5x&lt;br/&gt;价值与业务结果挂钩]\n  E --&gt; H[混合定价&lt;br/&gt;用量+结果叠加]\n  F --&gt; H</pre><p>值得注意的是，结果制本身又会反哺护城河：当计价单位与客户的真实业务结果绑定，供应商被深度嵌入业务流程，迁移成本进一步抬升——这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{integration}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{compliance}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ian</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 升高的微观机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入式金融与合规-ai-复刻不了的层\">嵌入式金融与合规：AI 复刻不了的层</h2><p>在所有被加固的护城河里，最「物理」的一条是嵌入式金融与受监管基础设施。原因很直白：AI 可以起草发票，但在没有持牌基础设施的情况下，它无法结算支付、无法承做贷款（<a href=\"https://www.saasmag.com/vertical-saas-outperforming-horizontal-2026/\">SaaS Mag</a>）。对垂直 SaaS 来说，叠加支付处理能带来相比纯 SaaS 高 2—3 倍的单客户收入，且这层金融基础设施恰好是大模型最难替代的——它不是智能问题，是牌照、清结算、风控与监管问题。</p>\n<p>把它和模型商品化放在一起看就能理解 2026 年的整体格局：智能（intelligence）在快速贬值，而「把智能落地到受监管现实世界」的能力在快速升值。垂直 SaaS 的赢家，正是那些站在监管边界、把 AI 当作上游廉价投入、把金融/合规/工作流当作下游护城河的公司。Baytech 给出的清单很直接——AI 复刻不了的那些才是仅剩的护城河：SEO、品牌、品味、速度、数据、信任（<a href=\"https://www.baytechconsulting.com/blog/why-generic-ai-startups-are-dead-executive-playbook-moats\">Baytech</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>护城河侵蚀的本质是<strong>价值上移</strong>：功能层（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）被模型商品化抹平，可防御价值压向工作流/数据/合规层（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>侵蚀的发动机是推理价格崩塌：GPT-4 级能力从约 20 美元/百万 token 跌到约 0.40 美元（<a href=\"https://a16z.com/llmflation-llm-inference-cost/\">a16z</a>），Gartner 预测到 2030 年再降 90% 以上。</li>\n<li>被严重侵蚀的护城河：专有 UI/学习成本、功能数量/套件捆绑、数据解析层——都是大模型最容易复刻的部分。</li>\n<li>被加固的护城河：专有运营数据、工作流所有权、嵌入式金融与合规——切换成本中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{integration}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{compliance}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ian</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 升高。</li>\n<li>定价随之重构：从席位制走向用量制与结果制，结果制让单客户收入达到席位制的 2—5 倍（<a href=\"https://www.validata.ai/post/from-tools-to-outcomes-why-agentic-ai-is-quietly-replacing-vertical-saas-in-regulated-industries\">Validata</a>）。</li>\n<li>对创业者的核心判断题：基础模型公司会先做横向、再切高毛利垂直；你能否在它们到来前筑起工作流护城河，决定了你是被侵蚀还是被加固。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"垂直 SaaS 与护城河侵蚀","id":"垂直-saas-与护城河侵蚀"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：护城河的「上移」","id":"核心概念-护城河的-上移"},{"level":2,"text":"模型商品化：侵蚀的发动机","id":"模型商品化-侵蚀的发动机"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流所有权：最硬的那条护城河","id":"工作流所有权-最硬的那条护城河"},{"level":2,"text":"定价模型的重构：从「席位」到「结果」","id":"定价模型的重构-从-席位-到-结果"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入式金融与合规：AI 复刻不了的层","id":"嵌入式金融与合规-ai-复刻不了的层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"API 平台竞争格局：2026 年 API 平台竞争格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/api-platform-landscape-2026"},"next":{"title":"定价策略与单位经济模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/pricing-strategy-and-unit-economics"}}